<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs close flat, market eyes PS congress.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs close flat, market eyes PS congress.</headline>
<text>
<p>1615 GMT - Linear bond futures closed flat, missing the start of a sharp sell-off in Germany. Market eyes leadership congress of scandal-torn govt party PS. Franc weakens again.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.66% (5.61) BE286=, 15 bps over Bunds (15)</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.02 at 123.13 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6315/45 (6260/90)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.35/45%, 1-wk repo 3.40/50</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
